(text "Zigbee, Thread and Z-Wave" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 14 0) (effects (font (size 3.5 3.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "30d678f4-a1e3-540f-9ba3-88a5cc36027a"))
(text "U19 Zigbee coordinator (EZSP NCP) with external antenna on J9. U20 OpenThread RCP with built-in antenna (Matter over Thread).\nSeparate radios so Zigbee and Thread never share airtime. UART with RTS/CTS, 115200 or 460800 baud. BOOT low at reset enters the\nGecko bootloader for firmware update over UART. J8/J10 are unpopulated SWD pads for factory programming and recovery.\nJ11 accepts a Raspberry Pi GPIO-header Z-Wave 800 module (pins 1-10 of the 40-pin header: Aeotec Z-Pi 800, Zooz ZAC93)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 21 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "518e452b-2a53-51d3-a282-0c6a6cf3acea"))
